WEBVTT

00:00.720 --> 00:06.400
Report to Your Highness I never expected huaicheng's commander Lu Yuan was once Yugong's student.

00:06.800 --> 00:12.040
I originally wanted to persuade him to surrender but he cursed Your Highness as unrighteous and unjust.

00:13.680 --> 00:17.840
I had no choice but to attack and beheaded him this battle.

00:18.160 --> 00:19.827
Our army suffered heavy losses.

00:22.720 --> 00:25.000
Your Highness don't look anymore.

00:31.280 --> 00:34.240
Back then I wronged him.

